          "title": "泰国拟禁止稀土开采化学品出口及过境运输以治理河流砷污染",
          "title_en": "Thailand plans ban on exports and transit of chemicals used in rare-earth mining to curb river pollution",
          "summary": "泰国副总理永猜·翁萨瓦11月21日在曼谷表示，由于泰国北部多条河流水体被检测出砷含量异常升高，泰国计划禁止用于稀土开采的化学品出口及过境运输，并将与缅甸等国合作治理污染。泰国官员将于11月24日与缅甸代表会面，并于11月25日至26日举行泰缅工作组会议。",
          "summary_en": "【Thailand plans ban on exports and transit of chemicals used in rare-earth mining to curb river pollution】Thailand plans to ban exports and transit shipments of chemicals used in rare-earth mining and work with Myanmar and other countries to address pollution",
